Changes from 3.0.10 to 3.0.11
============================

*Updated:
- composer.json requires se7enxweb/exponential (>=6.0.0 || dev-main) instead of se7enxweb/ezpublish, the
  kernel's old package name, which is abandoned on Packagist. The old requirement made Composer install the old
  kernel package next to se7enxweb/exponential, and composer audit failed on it. dev-main admits a project whose
  root package is the kernel on its main branch without a branch alias.
- composer.json replaces se7enxweb/ezfind-ls, this extension's old package name (abandoned on Packagist), so a
  project that still requires the old name resolves to this package alone.
- ezinfo.php and extension.xml state version 3.0.11.

Upgrading: nothing to do beyond composer update; no code, setting or database change.
